Sumitrā bids Kausalyā stop piteous wailing --- Sumitrā says Rāma in dharma never to pity --- Sumitrā praises Lakṣmaṇa compassionate service --- Sumitrā says sun will spare Rāma limbs --- Sumitrā says wind and moon will soothe Rāma --- Sumitrā recalls Brahmā divine weapons for Rāma --- Sumitrā foretells Rāma consecration with earth Sītā glory --- Sumitrā promises joyful return and foot-pressing --- Kausalyā grief vanishes like autumn cloud
